# AI-assisted translation; native-speaker review pending.
tethered.title = Kujambula ndi kamera yolumikizidwa
tethered.capture = Jambulani chithunzi
tethered.invalid_name = Sankhani dzina la mabayiti 1–120 lopanda mikwingwirima, madontho awiri, zizindikiro za peresenti kapena dontho loyambira.
tethered.install = Laibulale ya kamera ya dongosolo sikupezeka. Ikani pulogalamu yoyendetsera kamera ya chipangizochi ndipo muyambitsenso Schist.
tethered.timeout = Pempho la kamera latha nthawi. Yang'anani kamera ndipo mulumikizenso musanayesenso.
tethered.failed = Pempho la kamera lalephera: {detail}
tethered.unsupported = Kamera iyi sikusonyeza kuti imathandiza kujambula zithunzi patali.
tethered.no_download = Kamera sinatumize chithunzi chathunthu. Zithunzi zoyambirira zikusungidwabe mu kamera.
tethered.session_help = Sankhani kamera, kenako Jambulani chithunzi. Mukajambula koyamba, sankhani malo osungira ndi chiyambi cha dzina la fayilo; zithunzi zimawonjezeredwa nambala yotsatizana ndi chimaliziro cha fayilo cha kamera. Sungani Monga… imasintha malo ndi chiyambi cha dzina.
tethered.preview_failed = Chithunzicho chasungidwa ndi kulowetsedwa, koma chithunzi chake chowoneratu sichinathe kutsegulidwa. Chitseguleni mu mkonzi kuti muwone fayiloyo.
tethered.partial = Mafayilo ena a zithunzi asungidwa ndi kulowetsedwa; otsalawo sanathe kusungidwa: {error}
tethered.camera_permission = Lolani kugwiritsa ntchito kamera mu Zokonda za Dongosolo → Zinsinsi ndi Chitetezo → Kamera, kenako yesaninso Jambulani chithunzi. Ngati Schist inayambitsidwa kuchokera mu terminal, onaninso chilolezo cha kamera cha terminal imeneyo.
tethered.camera_usage_missing = Mtunduwu ulibe kufotokoza kwa chilolezo cha kamera. Mangani Schist kachiwiri ndi make kapena gwiritsani ntchito pulogalamu yokonzedwa kale.
tethered.select_camera = Sankhani kamera kuti mujambule chithunzi.
tethered.choose_destination = Jambulani chithunzi idzakufunsani komwe mungasungire zithunzi zanu.
tethered.preview_empty = Jambulani chithunzi kuti muchione pano.
